# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug
target

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
# Contains mutation testing data
**/mutants.out*/

# Added by cargo

/target

# Circuit binaries (V6/V7/V8 proving/verifying key data) - large content-
# addressed blobs fetched from go-zk-circuits' catalog, not vendored in
# git. Populate locally for dev/test via siros-org's circuit-distribution
# service (https://zk-circuits.fly.dev) rather than committing them here.
/circuits/

# UniFFI-generated bindings (see Makefile's `bindings` target) - not
# committed here, matching siros-wscd-manager's precedent: consuming SDK
# repos (siros-sdk-kotlin/siros-sdk-swift) vendor a generated copy into
# their own source tree instead.
/bindings/
